  "note": "Election of the Warrenpoint Urban District Council, 21 May 1952. East Ward (5 seats) was uncontested; West Ward (7 seats) was contested by eleven candidates. Eleven candidates for seven seats; Labour retained five of the six seats it held, losing that of Mr. J. Ogle to Mr. W. J. Hourican."
